OL,3,GNEWSAEducating Cardiff teacher given
OL,4,Asuspended sentence after sexually
OL,5,Aassaulting teenager
OL,6,
OL,7,FA teacher who featured in the Channel 4
OL,8,Fdocumentary series Educating Cardiff
OL,9,Fhas been given a suspended sentence for
OL,10,Fsexually assaulting a 17-year-old girl.
OL,12,FGareth Ritter, 44, of Bryngwyn, in
OL,13,FMonmouthshire, originally denied the
OL,14,Fsexual assault charge, but during his
OL,15,Ftrial in October changed his plea to
OL,16,Fguilty.
OL,18,FSentencing Ritter on Wednesday, Judge
OL,19,FDyfed Llion Thomas described the
OL,20,Fincident as a "cruel assault on a young
OL,21,Fwoman by an older man".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
